    <item>
      <title>Kaustav Bagchi : BJP নেতার নেতৃত্বে বিজেপি বিধায়ক কৌস্তভ বাগচীকে “গো ব্য়াক” স্লোগান, ভাইরাল ভিডিও</title>
      <link>https://bengali.abplive.com/district/north-24-paraganas/north-24-parganas-news-bjp-mla-kaustav-bagchi-clash-with-bjp-leader-faces-go-back-slogan-on-illegal-gas-breaking-news-1199353</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://bengali.abplive.com/district/north-24-paraganas/north-24-parganas-news-bjp-mla-kaustav-bagchi-clash-with-bjp-leader-faces-go-back-slogan-on-illegal-gas-breaking-news-1199353</guid>
